    "description": "Zippo Pipe Lighters\nLot of 2 Lighters, Black Matte and Brushed Chrome\nMade in USA, 2012 and 2014\nThis lot features two authentic Zippo pipe lighters, specifically designed for pipe smokers with a specialized chimney insert that allows the flame to be drawn directly into the pipe bowl without damaging it. Both lighters are marked with a pipe silhouette on the front corner and were manufactured in Bradford, Pennsylvania. These lighters are highly functional collectibles known for their durability and windproof design.\nItems Included:\nBlack Matte Zippo Pipe Lighter - Date code K 12 (November 2012), featuring a white pipe graphic and specialized chimney insert.\nBrushed Chrome Zippo Pipe Lighter - Date code J 14 (October 2014), featuring a black pipe graphic and specialized chimney insert.\nDimensions: Approximately 1.5 inches length, 1 inch width, 2.5 inches height per lighter.\nCondition:\nBoth lighters show signs of previous use including internal carbon buildup and soot in the chimneys. The black matte finish has light surface scuffing and minor wear along the edges. The brushed chrome finish shows typical pocket wear with fine hairline scratches. Hinges are secure and snap shut. Wicks are present but used; flint and fuel status has not been tested.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
